                             # "rank"    = ranked order (recurrence/magnitude)
                             # NOTE: ordering only. Which rows appear is decided
                             #   by GROUPS 1-3 either way.

## GROUP 2 — ELIGIBILITY ....................................................
##   which rows may enter the ranking at all
